          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"No complete award itinerary is shown, so neither award lead is ready to book. If a lower reported USD award-fee quote is your first check, start with the United lead below; the quote scope is unknown, so it is not evidence of lower total trip cost. The separate cash result gives a schedule and a price reference.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"This SFO–BKK economy award lead reports 60,500 United miles and USD 28.20 in award taxes, with 9 seats reported. Its schedule is date-only, so the flights, connections, and times are not established. The fee quote's scope is unknown, and the reported seat count does not confirm support for your one traveler or current availability.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"This is another SFO–BKK economy lead for January 1, reporting 42,500 Alaska miles, USD 50.90 in award taxes, and 8 seats. Its schedule is also date-only, with flights, connections, and times unestablished. The USD quote is $22.70 higher than the United lead's reported quote, but both quote scopes are unknown; the points are in different programs and cannot be compared as a points-price advantage. The reported seat count does not confirm support for your one traveler or current availability.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C2@2027-01-01T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — EVA Air via Taipei\",\"v\":\"The cash result reports USD 686.00, with unknown quote scope, for a one-stop SFO–TPE–BKK itinerary on EVA Air. It departs January 1 at 12:00 p.m. local time and arrives January 3 at 11:10 a.m. local time; elapsed time is 32 hours 10 minutes. This is a separate cash baseline, not a like-for-like total-cost comparison with either award quote.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Search results show no complete selectable award itinerary, and coverage is partial, so these leads may warrant a further check